{
  "_comment": "Edit this file to change what find_jobs.py looks for. Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby slugs are the name in the board URL, e.g. https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/forter -> 'forter'. A Comeet slug is both halves of its public board URL, e.g. https://www.comeet.com/jobs/thetaray/72.00F -> 'thetaray/72.00F'. Run find_jobs.py --verify to see which ones actually resolve. A Workday slug is tenant/wdN/site from the careers URL, e.g. https://intel.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/External -> 'intel/wd1/External'. SmartRecruiters slug = company id (wix2). Lever EU boards: 'eu:<slug>'. SuccessFactors: 'host/companyId', e.g. 'career2.successfactors.eu/1080030P'.",
